# Line endings: the Windows scripts and the C# sources are CRLF, the documentation is LF,
# and everything binary (the co-op server's DLLs, an exe, a zip) is left exactly as it is.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.cs text eol=crlf
*.manifest text eol=crlf
*.ini text eol=crlf
*.cfg text eol=crlf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
